OL,3,GNEWSAResidents' views sought over
OL,4,Ahousing campus
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents are being asked for their
OL,7,Fviews on plans to create a "a proper
OL,8,Fneighbourhood" in the heart of
OL,9,FMiddlesbrough, combining housing,
OL,10,Fschools, business and leisure
OL,11,Ffacilties.
OL,13,FMiddlesbrough Council and developer
OL,14,FCapital&Centric want to build 462 new
OL,15,Fhomes on land around the Old Town Hall
OL,16,Fin Middlehaven, to sit alongside
OL,17,Feducation and sports facilities, shops,
OL,18,Frestaurants and public gardens.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,393,390,260,160,0,100
