OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAResidents' views sought over
OL,4,Ahousing campus
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe developer said campus plans would
OL,7,F"introduce the missing piece" to the
OL,8,Farea, allowing residents "to live,
OL,9,Flearn, work and play, all in one
OL,10,Fplace".
OL,12,FCapital&Centric's Dan White urged
OL,13,Fpeople to join the public consultation
OL,14,Fand "tell us what they love, what they
OL,15,Fdon't and what would make it even
OL,16,Fbetter".
